        "text": "<thinking> To implement the profile_claims.py file, I need to fetch and normalize federated user profile claims using a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Cognito Identity Provider for this task, as it is a well-known service for handling federated logins and user profile information. The code will include the necessary imports and API calls to interact with Amazon Cognito, making the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
