        "text": "<thinking> To implement the oauth_callback.py file, I need to create a Python script that handles the callback from an OAuth provider and exchanges the authorization code for tokens. I will use the Google OAuth2 provider for this task, as it is a concrete external provider with a well-documented API. The script will import the necessary modules from the google-auth library, which is the official Google authentication library for Python. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
